# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the image needs (M5a AC2/AC3).
# Everything else stays out, in particular samples/ (real data, D12), .env and db/.env.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!tests/
!fixtures/
!scripts/

# Never, even inside allowed folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/samples
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.real.pdf
**/*.cioms.pdf
**/*.sas7bdat
**/*.xpt
